    <string name="welcome_heading">Welcome</string>
    <string name="welcome_subtitle">Pure Pixiv illustration, manga, and novel browsing</string>
    <string name="welcome_privacy_body">Huiguang is a third-party client for Pixiv offering illustration, manga, and novel browsing, search, and reading. After you agree to this notice, the app connects to the network to load Pixiv artworks and sync your follows and bookmarks (visiting the About page also sends an anonymous request to GitHub for the developer\'s public profile and avatar). When saving original artworks or exporting novel text files, the app writes files to your device\'s Download folder and stores your login session Cookie locally encrypted (passwords are never read or stored). We do not collect or upload personal privacy data.</string>
