    <string name="about_agreement_intro">Welcome to Huiguang. Before using this app, please carefully read and review the following user agreement and privacy notice:</string>
    <string name="about_agreement_sec_service_title">Nature of Service</string>
    <string name="about_agreement_sec_service_body">Huiguang is an unofficial third-party Pixiv client intended solely for personal study, technical research, and daily browsing.\n\nAll artworks, rankings, Pixivision features, and account data displayed are fetched directly from Pixiv\'s official services; this app hosts or redistributes no content.</string>
    <string name="about_agreement_sec_network_title">Network Access &amp; Data Usage</string>
    <string name="about_agreement_sec_network_body">Network permission is used to load Pixiv artwork details, media resources, novel contents, and search results.\n\nWhen you explicitly tap Follow or Bookmark, the client communicates directly with Pixiv\'s official servers to sync state without forwarding any interaction records to third-party servers.\n\nWhen you visit the About page, the app sends an anonymous read-only request to GitHub (api.github.com and avatars.githubusercontent.com) via an isolated clean HTTP client—without any Pixiv Referer, cookies, locale headers, or user/device identifiers—solely to fetch the developer\'s public profile and avatar.</string>
    <string name="about_agreement_sec_storage_title">Local Storage &amp; Credentials</string>
    <string name="about_agreement_sec_storage_body">Sign-in runs exclusively inside Pixiv\'s official web page. Your password is never seen, read, or stored; your session Cookie is encrypted locally using Android Keystore, and signing out clears both the local encrypted session and WebView cookies/caches.\n\nOriginal artworks and exported novel TXT files are written to the system public Download directory.\n\nBrowsing history, reading typography, bookmark caches, home feed cache, and image disk cache are stored in private local app storage with cloud backup and device-to-device transfer disabled.</string>
    <string name="about_agreement_sec_privacy_title">Privacy Commitment &amp; Fair Use</string>
    <string name="about_agreement_sec_privacy_body">Huiguang operates no custom backend and collects, analyzes, or uploads zero behavioral data, device identifiers, or personal information.\n\nPlease use reasonable request rates and comply with Pixiv\'s Terms of Use. Users assume responsibility for any account risks from third-party client usage.</string>
    <string name="about_copyright_sec_works_title">Works &amp; Trademarks</string>
    <string name="about_copyright_sec_works_body">"Pixiv", "Pixivision", and related logos and trademarks belong to Pixiv Inc.\n\nAll illustrations, manga, novels, covers, and embedded images displayed belong to their respective creators or rights holders.\n\nDo not use downloaded or exported works for commercial purposes, nor redistribute or repost them without explicit permission from the original author.</string>
    <string name="about_copyright_sec_ui_title">Design Language &amp; UI Components</string>
    <string name="about_copyright_sec_ui_body">The user interface is built upon the open-source COUI-Kit project under MPL-2.0 and its upstream TRADEMARKS.md policy.\n\nAll "ColorOS" related names and trademarks belong to Guangdong OPPO Mobile Telecommunications Corp., Ltd.</string>
    <string name="about_copyright_sec_disclaimer_title">Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="about_copyright_sec_disclaimer_body">This app has no official affiliation, authorization, partnership, or endorsement with Pixiv Inc. or any device manufacturer.\n\nHuiguang is provided "as is" without liability for service disruptions, functional changes, or data discrepancies caused by official API updates, network issues, or force majeure.</string>
    <string name="about_licenses_intro">This application uses the following open-source components in compliance with their respective licenses. Tap any license entry to read the full official license text:</string>
